19
00:00:36,160 --> 00:00:37,835
Use the Curiosity Pact:

20
00:00:37,835 --> 00:00:40,019
write down 'I will perform one

21
00:00:40,019 --> 00:00:43,150
specific action for fourteen days.' Publish

22
00:00:43,150 --> 00:00:44,316
ten short notes,

23
00:00:44,316 --> 00:00:45,626
test one workflow,

24
00:00:45,626 --> 00:00:47,738
or wake thirty minutes early,

25
00:00:47,738 --> 00:00:49,340
